        <name>HmacFn</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::storage::GGUFMetadata::HmacFn</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Callable type for a real HMAC-SHA256 implementation. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Signature: <computeroutput>std::string hmac(const std::string&amp; data, const std::string&amp; key)</computeroutput></para>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_g_g_u_f_metadata" kindref="compound">GGUFMetadata</ref></computeroutput> includes a secure OpenSSL HMAC-SHA256 default path. Inject a custom implementation via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_g_g_u_f_metadata_1a03469be6dabbbf892d4469529db1d233" kindref="member">setHmacFn()</ref></computeroutput> only when external crypto backends (e.g. KMS/HSM gateways) are required. The function must be thread-safe; it is called under no lock. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
